Docker decision reproduction supported the parent CRAG mock-API validation decision. It was not an exact numeric match; it preserved the decision, winners, rows, failure rate, and win/tie/loss while some floating metrics differed. See `docs/docker_reproduction.md` and `docs/crag_mock_api_validation.md`.

## Repository Migration Status

This repository was transferred from `AIM-RAGTune/rag-tuning-governance` and renamed to `RAGWarrant/ragwarrant-governance` through GitHub's native transfer and rename flow. The active project name, package, CLI, environment prefix, deployment examples, and documentation now use RAGWarrant naming. Historical run IDs, release artifacts, old URLs, and hash-bound evidence may retain RAGTune identifiers where changing them would break provenance. See `docs/migration/RAGTUNE_TO_RAGWARRANT.md`.

## Planned: v0.2

